============================================================
Step 5: Physical interpretation of generators
============================================================
  Each generator is a direction in log-space along which Pi is preserved.
  Physically: simultaneous rescaling of variables that keeps the
  normalised enthalpy Pi (and therefore the pore fraction) invariant.

  Generator 1:
    P x exp(-0.330*eps), V x exp(+0.930*eps), Lv x exp(+0.068*eps), dT x exp(+0.122*eps), Tb x exp(+0.050*eps)
    Meaning: increase V while decrease P, increase Lv, increase dT, increase Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 2:
    P x exp(-0.058*eps), A x exp(+0.998*eps)
    Meaning: increase A while decrease P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 3:
    P x exp(-0.204*eps), rho x exp(+0.973*eps), dT x exp(+0.075*eps)
    Meaning: increase rho while decrease P, increase dT
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 4:
    P x exp(-0.105*eps), k x exp(+0.993*eps)
    Meaning: increase k while decrease P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 5:
    P x exp(+0.321*eps), V x exp(+0.068*eps), Lv x exp(+0.934*eps), dT x exp(-0.118*eps)
    Meaning: increase Lv while increase P, increase V, decrease dT
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 6:
    P x exp(+0.575*eps), V x exp(+0.122*eps), rho x exp(+0.075*eps), Lv x exp(-0.118*eps), dT x exp(+0.788*eps), gamma x exp(+0.062*eps), Tb x exp(-0.088*eps)
    Meaning: increase dT while increase P, increase V, increase rho, decrease Lv, increase gamma, decrease Tb
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 7:
    P x exp(-0.169*eps), dT x exp(+0.062*eps), gamma x exp(+0.982*eps)
    Meaning: increase gamma while decrease P, increase dT
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 8:
    P x exp(+0.239*eps), V x exp(+0.050*eps), dT x exp(-0.088*eps), Tb x exp(+0.964*eps)
    Meaning: increase Tb while increase P, increase V, decrease dT
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged


